Author: Youngsun Kim [aut, cre] (ORCID:
    <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8003-1939>), Hwan Chung [aut] (ORCID:
    <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8969-9086>)
Maintainer: Youngsun Kim <yskstat@gmail.com>
Description: Provides comprehensive tools for the implementation of
    Structural Latent Class Models (SLCM), including Latent Transition
    Analysis (LTA; Linda M. Collins and Stephanie T. Lanza, 2009)
    <doi:10.1002/9780470567333>, Latent Class Profile Analysis (LCPA; Hwan
    Chung et al., 2010) <doi:10.1111/j.1467-985x.2010.00674.x>, and Joint
    Latent Class Analysis (JLCA; Saebom Jeon et al., 2017)
    <doi:10.1080/10705511.2017.1340844>, and any other extended models
    involving multiple latent class variables. Details on the methodology
    and implementation are given in Kim and Chung (2026)
    <doi:10.18637/jss.v117.i08>.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://kim0sun.github.io/slca/
